/T (Team Nyx is a passionate, student-led robotics team that is commited to innovation, engineering, and community impact, but none of that is possible without the resources to back it up. Your sponsorship goes directly towards specially-designed robot parts and compenents, competition registration and travel fees, professional uniforms, outreach events, and more where we inspire the next generation of STEM leaders. Every dollar donated is a dollar invested in students who are not just building a robot, but who are developing the skills, impact, and experience to change the world.  )
