/P 100 0 R
/E (Building a competitive FRC robot requires a significant amount of raw materials and consumables, and we are reaching out to local suppliers and manufacturers to ask for donations of materials that would directly go into our robot and team operations. We are looking for items like aluminum extrusion, steel tubing, fasteners, electronics components, wiring, and connectors catering, as well as anything else your company may be able to contribute. )
