223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (Competing at regional and championship events means getting 50+ students, a full robot, and all of our equipment across the city or even across the country, and travel costs are one of the most significant expenses any FRC team faces. We are reaching out to ask if your company would be willing to support us through transportation, lodging, or freight shipping. Whether that means providing a van or truck to move our robot, covering hotel rooms for competition weekends, or sponsoring the cost of shipping our robot to a championship event, any travel support will be greatly appreciated. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
